cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code, please cite the paper it accompanies."
title: >-
  Recovered glomerular counts relative to renal mass distinguish FVB/N from
  three other inbred mouse strains: phenotypic characterisation and
  bias-corrected developmental transcriptome analysis
abstract: >-
  Analysis code for the revised manuscript. Covers read trimming, alignment to
  FVB/N personalised genomes, quantification, differential expression,
  mapping-bias quality control, candidate prioritisation, allele-dosage
  concordance, gene-set enrichment, cell-composition deconvolution and every
  figure and table reported in the paper.
type: software
version: v1.0-revision
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/masakiwatanabe-labani/fvb-nephron-density"
